{"code":"115480","name":"씨유메디칼","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"건강관리장비와용품","sector_desc":"의료기기·진단기기·의료용품. 수출 비중이 높고 인허가와 해외 판매 성과가 핵심입니다.","desc":"동사는 2001년 의료기기 개발, 제조 및 판매를 목적으로 설립되었으며, 2011년 코스닥시장에 상장하였음. 당기 중 (주)비스토스 지분을 취득하여 연결대상 종속회사로 편입하였음. 동사는 아시아 최초로 자동심장충격기(AED)를 개발한 응급의료기기 전문기업으로, 심장충격기 및 관련 사업과 태아 및 신생아 관련 의료기기, 환자감시장치 등을 제조하여 국내외에 공급하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-29","n_days":300,"close":2075.0,"open":2075.0,"high":2100.0,"low":1979.0,"volume":11051,"amount":22930825.0,"ret_1d":2.2167,"gap":2.2167,"range_pct":5.8313,"ret_5":0.4843,"ret_20":-10.5603,"ret_60":21.7009,"ret_120":-24.2701,"ret_250":-31.405,"ma20":2163.35,"ma60":2190.25,"ma120":2122.4333,"ma200":2380.51,"close_vs_ma200":-12.8338,"close_vs_ma60":-5.262,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":41.9139,"r2_60":0.0757,"slope_120":2.5605,"r2_120":0.0007,"slope_250":-37.3143,"r2_250":0.5674,"high52":3310.0,"low52":1624.0,"pos_52w":26.7497,"dd_52w":-37.3112,"mdd_1y":-47.0497,"atr14_pct":6.9191,"vol_ann_60":63.3068,"vol_avg20":13965.3,"vol_ratio20":0.7913,"vr5":0.6437,"vr20":0.31,"amount_avg5":26007626.2,"amount_avg20":30107553.3,"amount_avg60":44365189.2833,"obv_chg20":-18.3673,"turnover_20":2.3036,"pv_eff_20":-4.5843,"rsi14":44.9574,"frgn_net_5":7164.0,"inst_net_5":-8347.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":0.0591,"inst_net_5_pct":-0.0688,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0098,"frgn_net_20":31719.0,"inst_net_20":-15012.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.2616,"inst_net_20_pct":-0.1238,"smart_net_20_pct":0.1378,"frgn_net_60":-3370.0,"inst_net_60":-15012.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":-0.0278,"inst_net_60_pct":-0.1238,"smart_net_60_pct":-0.1516,"frgn_net_120":-113567.0,"inst_net_120":-42171.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":-0.9366,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.3478,"smart_net_120_pct":-1.2844,"foreign_ratio":0.0,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":0.0,"smart_buy_streak":1,"op_income_q":59.0,"op_margin_q":27.8302,"op_qoq":136.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":84.375,"rev_yoy":70.9677,"op_trend_4q":23.8926,"fin_period":"202606","roe":14.82,"debt_ratio":75.2,"per":2.59,"pbr":0.36,"div_yiel